Corresponding source
--------------------
The local installer ships tree-sitter-nusmv/grammar.js and generated src/
(including parser.c and Tree-sitter headers), together with package manifests,
build scripts, README.md, LICENSE and this NOTICE beside grammars/nusmv.wasm.
The optional tree-sitter-nusmv/tree-sitter.json is included when present.
Keep this source and the notices available under EPL-1.0 when redistributing
the grammar binary. Third-party tools and dependencies retain their own
licences; the wasi-sdk download and node_modules are not included in the bundle.
